//	Notes:
//	It might be interesting, some day, to create a normal X++
//	class visibility hierarchy for the Urdi code.  Right now, though,
//	 - it's thoroughly debugged as is.
//	 - debugging it is a bitch.
//	so I've elected to keep it in the old form for the time being.
//
